  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MFC Grains and Horticulture Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assistance will improve the capacity of management to direct and control operations at MFC through strengthening internal controls and establishing a business plan, policies and procedures. The ability to purchase more commodities from farmers will be enhanced. Assistance will also provide training in post-harvest handling and storage, enterprise planning, and corporate governance to name a few.</narrative>
  </description>
